cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Vision impairment due to age-related macular degeneration in the Global Burden of Disease Study 2023: analysis code"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Python code that reproduces the tables and figures of a study of vision
  impairment due to age-related macular degeneration based on the Global
  Burden of Disease Study (GBD) 2023. It quantifies how GBD 2023 revised the
  GBD 2021 estimates, checks the internal consistency of a published GBD
  2021-based projection, projects the number of people affected to 2050 at
  constant 2023 rates, and describes trends from 1990 to 2023. GBD estimates
  are not redistributed; the data guide gives the exact GBD Results Tool
  settings for every input file.
